        "original_id": "bfa7434e-302b-555c-8e91-a02595245e4f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ronaldinho, Samuel Eto'o\n- Awards: FIFA World Player of the Year, Ballon d'Or\n- Topics: football honors, player legacy\n\nFacts:\n- Ronaldinho was named FIFA World Player of the Year for 2005 for the second consecutive time and received the highest points total ever for the award.\n- Samuel Eto'o finished third in the 2005 FIFA World Player of the Year voting.\n- Ronaldinho won two FIFA World Player of the Year awards and one Ballon d'Or.\n- Ronaldinho is often considered one of the best players of his generation and is regarded by many as one of the greatest footballers of all time.",
